WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.128 --> 00:00:01.351
(Christmas music)

00:00:01.351 --> 00:00:04.101
(pen scratching)

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.503
- My name is Blake from North Carolina.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.970
This year, I want football
gloves and a gold chain.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:19.233
I want the gold chain
because I could look cool,

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.920
and look like...

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:27.920
I already look cool, but it's
just I wanna look cooler.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:31.140
I wanna look drip, and so...

00:00:33.041 --> 00:00:33.917
Yeah.

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:35.289
(audience cheering)

00:00:35.289 --> 00:00:36.166
(Kelly laughing and clapping)

00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:38.666
- So for those of you over 40,

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.950
drip means, like, an awesome
sense of style or swag.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:46.140
You learn something new every day

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.920
here on "The Kelly Clarkson
Show," including myself.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.240
Like we do every year, though,

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.760
this season we've paired up
with our season-long partner,

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.860
Pilot Frixion Pen, the go-to erasable pen

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:59.370
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show,"
to give Santa a helping hand.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:02.130
And Blake, we want to
celebrate kids like you

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:04.800
creating fearless and
bold holiday wishlists,

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:08.119
so we're giving you $1,000
for gloves and a new necklace

00:01:08.119 --> 00:01:09.711
to make you look drip.

00:01:09.711 --> 00:01:11.217
(audience cheering)

00:01:11.217 --> 00:01:13.290
And to everyone watching, remember,

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.750
you can pick up Pilot
Frixion erasable pens

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.553
wherever office supplies are sold.

